[om:F]C[This move may be a mistake. If black 119 had been at 120 then white would have had trouble escaping with his group. However had white played 118 at 120, followed through with the sequence to 125, and then played 'E', forcing black to connect with 'F', he would stand far more chance of making a second eye for his group or escaping. ]
